In order to determine (on paper) whether this program should have UB, we look at the [definition](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/std/ffi/struct.VaList.html#safety) of what types are compatible. In this case, `T` = `*const &'static str`, and `U` = `*const &'data str`. Since `T` and `U` are both pointers, we check whether `&'static str` and `&'data str` are compatible.

